OL,3,AEx-White House teleprompter operator
OL,4,Aordered to pay $172,000 for Trump
OL,5,Aspeech bets
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former White House teleprompter
OL,8,Foperator has been ordered to pay more
OL,9,Fthan $172,000 (#127,000) for using
OL,10,Finside information to bet on US
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump's speeches.
OL,13,FGabriel Perez was found to have made
OL,14,Ftrades on what the president would say
OL,15,Fduring addresses between December 2025
OL,16,Fand February 2026 on Kalshi - a
OL,17,Fprediction markets platform where users
OL,18,Fcan bet on real-world events.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
